  "business_overview": "Nuburu, Inc. engages in the development and delivery of blue laser technology for the welding and 3D printing industries in the United States, Asia, Europe, and internationally. The company offers NUBURU BL-250, a blue laser product. It is also involved in the design, production, and outfitting of a range of vehicles for industrial and military applications, as well as electronic devices for defense and security, advanced telecommunications, and tracking systems. In addition, it offers operational resilience solutions; and sells and installs high-powered lasers. The company serves EV batteries, medical device production, large screen displays, and cell phone components applications. Nuburu, Inc. was founded in 2015 and is headquartered in Denver, Colorado.",
